# AWS S3 설정 - 실제 값은 절대 커밋하지 마세요!
# 빌드 시 아래 방식으로 주입하세요:
#
# flutter build apk \
#   --dart-define=AWS_ACCESS_KEY=YOUR_ACCESS_KEY_ID \
#   --dart-define=AWS_SECRET_KEY=YOUR_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY \
#   --dart-define=AWS_REGION=ap-northeast-2 \
#   --dart-define=AWS_BUCKET=floor-measure-storage

AWS_ACCESS_KEY=YOUR_ACCESS_KEY_ID
AWS_SECRET_KEY=YOUR_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
AWS_REGION=ap-northeast-2
AWS_BUCKET=floor-measure-storage
